This is the sample input weather file.  The first three columns are the day,
hour and year; subsequent columns are hourly air temperature (C), wind speed
(m/s), relative humidity (%), precipitation (mm), density of newly fallen 
snow (g/cm3; specified optionally), and incoming solar radiation (W/m2).  In 
this example, the model was run from day 338, hour 12, year 1986 to the end of
day 350; therefore, data must be present for each hour from the beginning of day
338 to the end of day 350.  

(Daily input weather data may be optionally used.)
